        "name": "コロンビーナ",
        "desc": "ナド・クライで生まれた「月の少女」——故郷へと帰る、空月。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/01/13/80fa97679c8d1828fdd96c6aa9638632_4327573591148809640.png",
